    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Rathfarnham are delighted to present 126 AW Pugin House. An attractive ground floor two-bedroom apartment 126 is quite unique in its style being one of the very few own-door units within the development and boasting two large balcony terraces. Presented in well maintained condition and benefitting from recent redecoration the apartment is perfect for buyers seeking a property in walk-in condition. \n\nBuilt in 2006 Loreto Abbey is a substantial high quality apartment development that comprises nine distinct buildings constructed on land to the rear of the beautiful Abbey which is now used as a school. The apartments are set around beautiful communal gardens, and the development boasts attractive water features and mature planting. \n\nLoreto Abbey benefits from two very large underground car parks for residents which also boast secure bike lockups. There is generous visitor parking within the development. All floors in the development including the underground car parks are serviced by lifts. A well maintained and quiet development residents enjoy the quality of the build along with the excellent location close to a wealth of amenities including three parks, Bushy Park, Saint Enda's Park and Marlay Park as well as a choice of schools at all levels, a creche and Rathfarnham Village which is just a short stroll away as well as regular bus services passing nearby.\n \nAW Pugin House is arguably the best positioned building in the development and apartment 126 benefits from a great outlook to the communal courtyard and fountain at the front and the lovely communal garden space and Abbey to the rear. Both of the properties two balcony spaces offer ample room to sit outside and enjoy the outdoor space. Inside the property offers well laid out accommodation of approximately 62 square metres including a welcoming entrance hall with utility room, large living/dining room with kitchen off and balcony access. To the rear of the property there is a bathroom, two double bedrooms including the master with en-suite bathroom and balcony access from each bedroom. \n\nA very well finished property with high quality materials used throughout, Apartment 126 AW Pugin House has been lovingly maintained by the current owner and comes to the market ready for its next owner with no onward chain. The property benefits from a designated parking space in the secure underground car park and there is potential for owners to acquire further spaces directly from the management company subject to availability. \n\nViewing of this fine property comes highly recommended and can be arranged with selling agent Dan Steen."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.5m x 1.5m\nWelcoming own-door entrance hall with laminate wood flooring, intercom, and utility room off.\n\nUtility Room - 2.55m x 1.0m\nPractical utility room with tile flooring, Finlux washing machine and fitted shelving.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.25m\nGenerous fully tiled bathroom with wc, wash basin and large shower.\n\nFront Balcony/Terrace - \nGenerous private terrace with ample space for seating and/or al fresco dining. Overlooks communal courtyard with attractive water feature.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 5.35m x 4.0m\nBright and spacious living/dining room with laminate wood flooring, kitchen off and door to balcony/terrace.\n\nKitchen - 2.6m x 2.1m\nFully fitted contemporary kitchen with tile flooring, marble countertops, extensive storage with under-counter lighting, Whirlpool electric oven & hob, Zanussi integrated dishwasher and Whirlpool fridge-freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.35m x 2.65m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, door to balcony/terrace and en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.55m x 2.0m\nLarge tiled en-suite bathroom with w.c., wash basin and full-size bath with shower attachment.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.85m x 2.65m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes, and door to balcony/terrace.\n\nRear Balcony/Terrace - \nGenerous private terrace with ample space for seating. Overlooks communal garden space and historic Loreto Abbey building.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom own-door ground floor apartment</li><li> Great position in large mature private development</li><li> Unique layout with two private balcony/terraces</li><li> Beautifully maintained & presented in walk-in condition</li><li> Designated parking space in private secure car park</li><li> Good quality materials throughout</li><li> Two generous bathrooms and separate utility room</li><li> Excellent location close to a wealth of amenities</li><li> Annual service charge c.2,784</li><li> C3 BER rating with gas fired central heating</ul>"
      },
